cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper
  (preferred-citation below) and, if relevant, this software.
type: software
title: >-
  Multi-parameter Bézier optimization of cam mechanisms with negative
  radius follower: DE + ALM optimizer and cam-profile generator
abstract: >-
  Python code that maximizes the follower lift of a cam with a
  negative-radius follower driven by a Bézier motion law with two free
  ordinates, using Differential Evolution, an Augmented Lagrangian Method
  for the no-undercutting and pressure-angle constraints, and a periodic
  local search. A second script draws the cam profile of a given design
  and exports its coordinates.
